      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِحْلِيلٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَحِلٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Quick,</i> or <i>swift:</i>
